 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\" class=\"no-js\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">\n    <meta name=\"csrf-token\" content=\"1795715966:MtLOWwGlfdBCTW0YoBMyL/q5AGv/Tb6cUJFGCl696Jk=\">\n    <meta name=\"renderer\" content=\"webkit\">\n    <script>\n        window.__feInitLocalTime = new Date().getTime() / 1000;\n        window.__feConfigVersion = '74d532c6c7861bfe'; window.__feConfigRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/config'; window.__fePhoneHomeCall = 'https\\u003A\\/\\/moshimoshi\\u003Aagltb3noatpwohhuenb5ag1tc2jsnnl3\\u0040errtrack.luogu.com.cn\\/lotlp1';        window.__luoguTagVersion = 'zh\\u002DCN\\/2026112601'; window.__luoguTagRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/tags';\n    </script>\n    <title>题解 P1308 [NOIP2011 普及组] 统计单词数 - 洛谷专栏</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/favicon.ico\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-inline' luogu.com *.luogu.com luogu.com.cn *.luogu.com.cn luogu.org *.luogu.org wss: blob: luoguprivate.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com luogu.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.dun.163yun.com https://*.dun.163.com https://*.nosdn.126.net https://*.nosdn.127.net https://nos.netease.com https://cstaticdun.126.net https://cstaticdun1.126.net https://cstaticdun-v6.126.net https://acstatic-dun.126.net; img-src * data:; font-src * data:; worker-src data: blob:; frame-src https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn https://player.bilibili.com https://www.bilibili.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com\">\n        <script id=\"lentille-context\" type=\"application/json\">{\"instance\":\"main\",\"template\":\"article.show\",\"status\":200,\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"data\":{\"article\":{\"lid\":\"03xk59dp\",\"title\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3 P1308 [NOIP2011 \\u666e\\u53ca\\u7ec4] \\u7edf\\u8ba1\\u5355\\u8bcd\\u6570\",\"category\":2,\"time\":1736323104,\"author\":{\"uid\":930718,\"avatar\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/usericon\\/930718.png\",\"name\":\"Eason_lyx\",\"slogan\":\"CSP 2026 J2 S2 \\u0026NOIP rp++|\\u4e0d\\u62ff\\u84dd\\u94a9\\u4e0d\\u6539\\u7b7e|\\u70b9\\u4e2a\\u5173\\u6ce8\\u5457|\\u4f55\\u65f6\\u624d\\u80fd\\u5c0f\\u6709\\u6240\\u6210\",\"badge\":null,\"isAdmin\":false,\"isBanned\":false,\"color\":\"Red\",\"ccfLevel\":6,\"xcpcLevel\":0,\"background\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/image_hosting\\/x08a14de.png\"},\"upvote\":359,\"replyCount\":28,\"favorCount\":4,\"status\":2,\"solutionFor\":{\"pid\":\"P1308\",\"type\":\"P\",\"name\":\"[NOIP 2011 \\u666e\\u53ca\\u7ec4] \\u7edf\\u8ba1\\u5355\\u8bcd\\u6570\",\"difficulty\":2,\"fullScore\":100},\"promoteStatus\":2,\"collection\":null,\"content\":\"\\u535a\\u5ba2\\u6548\\u679c**\\u66f4\\u4f73**-\\u003E[\\u6d1b\\u8c37\\u535a\\u5ba2](https:\\/\\/www.luogu.com.cn\\/article\\/03xk59dp)\\u3002\\n\\nupdate on 2025.1.12\\uff1a\\n- \\u4fee\\u6b63\\u4e86\\u8d85\\u94fe\\u63a5\\u3002\\n- \\u4fee\\u6b63\\u4e86\\u4ee3\\u7801\\u4e2d\\u5b58\\u5728\\u7684\\u95ee\\u9898\\u3002\\u611f\\u8c22 [FPXS11GO](https:\\/\\/www.luogu.com.cn\\/user\\/570842) \\u5728\\u8bc4\\u8bba\\u533a\\u7684\\u63d0\\u9192\\u3002\\n## \\u9898\\u76ee\\u5927\\u610f\\n\\u003E \\u7ed9\\u5b9a\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u5355\\u8bcd\\uff0c\\u8bf7\\u4f60\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u5b83\\u5728\\u7ed9\\u5b9a\\u7684\\u6587\\u7ae0\\u4e2d\\u51fa\\u73b0\\u7684\\u6b21\\u6570\\u548c**\\u7b2c\\u4e00\\u6b21**\\u51fa\\u73b0\\u7684\\u4f4d\\u7f6e\\u3002\\u6ce8\\u610f\\uff1a\\u5339\\u914d\\u5355\\u8bcd\\u65f6\\uff0c**\\u4e0d\\u533a\\u5206\\u5927\\u5c0f\\u5199**\\uff0c\\u4f46\\u8981\\u6c42\\u5b8c\\u5168\\u5339\\u914d\\u3002\\u5373\\u7ed9\\u5b9a\\u5355\\u8bcd\\u5fc5\\u987b\\u4e0e\\u6587\\u7ae0\\u4e2d\\u7684\\u67d0\\u4e00\\u72ec\\u7acb\\u5355\\u8bcd\\u5728\\u4e0d\\u533a\\u5206\\u5927\\u5c0f\\u5199\\u7684\\u60c5\\u51b5\\u4e0b\\u5b8c\\u5168\\u76f8\\u540c\\uff0c\\u5982\\u679c\\u7ed9\\u5b9a\\u5355\\u8bcd\\u4ec5\\u662f\\u6587\\u7ae0\\u4e2d\\u67d0\\u4e00\\u5355\\u8bcd\\u7684\\u4e00\\u90e8\\u5206\\u5219\\u4e0d\\u7b97\\u5339\\u914d\\u3002   \\n## \\u9898\\u76ee\\u5206\\u6790\\n- \\u58f0\\u660e\\u53d8\\u91cf\\u3002\\n\\n```cpp\\nstring dan,ci,s;\\nint cur=-1,ans;\\n```\\n`dan` \\u7528\\u4e8e\\u62c6\\u5206 `s` \\u4e2d\\u7684\\u6bcf\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u5355\\u8bcd\\uff0c `ci` \\u662f\\u76ee\\u6807\\u5355\\u8bcd\\uff0c `cur` \\u662f\\u4e0b\\u6807\\uff0c `ans` \\u8f93\\u51fa\\u7b54\\u6848\\u3002\\n\\n- \\u8f93\\u5165\\u5e76\\u89e3\\u51b3\\u5927\\u5c0f\\u5199\\u95ee\\u9898\\u3002\\n```cpp\\ncin\\u003E\\u003Eci;\\n    for(int i=0;i\\u003Cci.size();++i)ci[i]=tolower(ci[i]);\\n    getchar();\\n    getline(cin,s);\\n    s+=\\u0027 \\u0027;\\n    for(int i=0;i\\u003Cs.size();++i)s[i]=tolower(s[i]);\\n```\\n- \\u7edf\\u8ba1\\u4e0e\\u8ba1\\u6570\\u3002\\n```cpp\\nfor(int i=0;i\\u003Cs.size();++i)\\n{\\n        if(s[i]==\\u0027 \\u0027){\\n            if(dan==ci){\\n                ans++;\\n                if(cur==-1)cur=i-ci.size();\\n            }\\n            dan=\\u0022\\u0022;\\n        }\\n        else dan+=s[i];\\n}\\n```\\n\\u5982\\u679c\\u662f\\u7a7a\\u683c\\uff0c\\u5224\\u65ad\\u662f\\u5426\\u4e0e\\u76ee\\u6807 `ci` \\u76f8\\u540c\\uff1b\\u5982\\u679c\\u4e0d\\u662f\\uff0c\\u66f4\\u65b0\\u53d8\\u91cf `dan` \\u3002\\n\\n- \\u8f93\\u51fa\\n```cpp\\nif(ans==0)printf(\\u0022-1\\u0022);\\nelse printf(\\u0022%d %d\\u0022,ans,cur);\\n```  \\n## \\u4ee3\\u7801\\n\\n```cpp\\n#include\\u003Cbits\\/stdc++.h\\u003E\\nusing namespace std;\\nstring dan,ci,s;\\nint cur=-1,ans;\\nint main()\\n{\\n    cin\\u003E\\u003Eci;\\n    for(int i=0;i\\u003Cci.size();++i)ci[i]=tolower(ci[i]);\\n    getchar();\\n    getline(cin,s);\\n    s+=\\u0027 \\u0027;\\/\\/\\u8fd9\\u884c\\u5f88\\u91cd\\u8981\\uff0c\\u5173\\u7cfb\\u7740\\u6700\\u540e\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u5355\\u8bcd\\u4f1a\\u4e0d\\u4f1a\\u626b\\u63cf\\u5230\\n    for(int i=0;i\\u003Cs.size();++i)s[i]=tolower(s[i]);\\n    for(int i=0;i\\u003Cs.size();++i)\\n    {\\n        if(s[i]==\\u0027 \\u0027){\\n            if(dan==ci){\\n                ans++;\\n                if(cur==-1)cur=i-ci.size();\\n            }\\n            dan=\\u0022\\u0022;\\n        }\\n        else dan+=s[i];\\n    }\\n    if(ans==0)printf(\\u0022-1\\u0022);\\n    else printf(\\u0022%d %d\\u0022,ans,cur);\\n    return 0;\\n}\\n```  \\n[\\u8bc4\\u6d4b\\u8bb0\\u5f55](https:\\/\\/www.luogu.com.cn\\/record\\/130449036)\\u3002\\n\\n\\n\\u672c\\u4eba\\u7b2c\\u4e00\\u6b21\\u5199\\u9898\\u89e3\\uff0c\\u5982\\u6709\\u7801\\u98ce\\u6216\\u6392\\u7248\\u65b9\\u9762\\u7684\\u4e0d\\u8db3\\uff0c\\u8bf7\\u591a\\u591a\\u8c05\\u89e3\\u3002\\n\\n~~\\u6c42\\u70b9\\u8d5e\\u3002~~\",\"contentFull\":true,\"adminNote\":null},\"favored\":false,\"voted\":null,\"canReply\":false,\"canEdit\":false},\"user\":null,\"time\":1795629566.405999}</script>            <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.css\" />\n    <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/vendor.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/03xk59dp\" />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3 P1308 [NOIP2011 \\u666e\\u53ca\\u7ec4] \\u7edf\\u8ba1\\u5355\\u8bcd\\u6570\",\"description\":\"\\u535a\\u5ba2\\u6548\\u679c\\u66f4\\u4f73-&gt;\\u6d1b\\u8c37\\u535a\\u5ba2\\u3002\\nupdate on 2025.1.12\\uff1a\\n\\n\\u4fee\\u6b63\\u4e86\\u8d85\\u94fe\\u63a5\\u3002\\n\\u4fee\\u6b63\\u4e86\\u4ee3\\u7801\\u4e2d\\u5b58\\u5728\\u7684\\u95ee\\u9898\\u3002\\u611f\\u8c22 FPXS11GO \\u5728\\u8bc4\\u8bba\\u533a\\u7684\\u63d0\\u9192\\u3002\\u9898\\u76ee\\u5927\\u610f\\n\\n\\u7ed9\\u5b9a\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u5355\\u8bcd\\uff0c\\u8bf7\\u4f60\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u5b83\\u5728\\u7ed9\\u5b9a\\u7684\\u6587\\u7ae0\\u4e2d\\u51fa\\u73b0\\u7684\\u6b21\\u6570\\u548c\\u7b2c\\u4e00\\u6b21\\u51fa\\u73b0\\u7684\\u4f4d\\u7f6e\\u3002\\u6ce8\\u610f\\uff1a\\u5339\\u914d\\u5355\\u8bcd\\u65f6\\uff0c\\u4e0d\\u533a\\u5206\\u5927\\u5c0f\\u5199\\uff0c\\u4f46\\u8981\\u6c42\\u5b8c\\u5168\\u5339\\u914d\\u3002\\u5373\\u7ed9\\u5b9a\\u5355\\u8bcd\\u5fc5\\u987b\\u4e0e\\u6587\\u7ae0\\u4e2d\\u7684\\u67d0\\u4e00\\u72ec\\u7acb\\u5355\\u8bcd\\u5728\\u4e0d\\u533a\\u5206\\u5927\\u5c0f\\u5199\\u7684\\u60c5\\u51b5\\u4e0b\\u5b8c\\u5168\\u76f8\\u540c\\uff0c\\u5982\\u679c\\u7ed9\\u5b9a\\u5355\\u8bcd\\u4ec5\\u662f\\u6587\\u7ae0\\u4e2d\\u67d0\\u4e00\\u5355\\u8bcd\\u7684\\u4e00\\u90e8\\u5206\\u5219\\u4e0d\\u7b97\\u5339\\u914d\\u3002\\u2026\",\"genre\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Eason_lyx\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-01-08T15:58:24+08:00\"}</script>\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"题解 P1308 [NOIP2011 普及组] 统计单词数\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"博客效果更佳-&amp;gt;洛谷博客。\nupdate on 2025.1.12：\n\n修正了超链接。\n修正了代码中存在的问题。感谢 FPXS11GO 在评论区的提醒。题目大意\n\n给定一个单词，请你输出它在给定的文章中出现的次数和第一次出现的位置。注意：匹配单词时，不区分大小写，但要求完全匹配。即给定单词必须与文章中的某一独立单词在不区分大小写的情况下完全相同，如果给定单词仅是文章中某一单词的一部分则不算匹配。…\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:section\" content=\"题解\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:author\" content=\"Eason_lyx\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-01-08T15:58:24+08:00\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/03xk59dp\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"洛谷专栏\" />\n        <script id=\"luogu-theme\" type=\"application/json\">{\"id\":1,\"lNavi\":{\"back\":\"#ffffff\",\"fore\":\"#262626\",\"logo\":null},\"lBody\":{\"back\":\"#f0f4fa\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-l.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}},\"dNavi\":{\"back\":\"#1d2025\",\"fore\":\"#ffffff\",\"logo\":\"#ffffff\"},\"dBody\":{\"back\":\"#0d1018\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-d.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}}}</script>\n    <style></style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"app\">\n    <noscript>\n        <h3>请<b style=\"color:#f00;\">不要禁用</b>脚本，否则网页无法正常加载</h3>\n    </noscript>\n        <article>\n        <h1>题解 P1308 [NOIP2011 普及组] 统计单词数</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: .75em;\">\n            <a rel=\"author\">Eason_lyx</a>\n            ·\n            <time datetime=\"2025-01-08T15:58:24+08:00\">2025-01-08 15:58:24</time>\n            ·\n            <a href=\"/article?category=2\">题解</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>博客效果<strong>更佳</strong>-&gt;洛谷博客。</p>\n<p>update on 2025.1.12：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>修正了超链接。</li>\n<li>修正了代码中存在的问题。感谢 FPXS11GO 在评论区的提醒。<h2>题目大意</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>给定一个单词，请你输出它在给定的文章中出现的次数和<strong>第一次</strong>出现的位置。注意：匹配单词时，<strong>不区分大小写</strong>，但要求完全匹配。即给定单词必须与文章中的某一独立单词在不区分大小写的情况下完全相同，如果给定单词仅是文章中某一单词的一部分则不算匹配。   </p>\n<h2>题目分析</h2>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n<li>声明变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">string dan,ci,s;\nint cur=-1,ans;</code></pre>\n<p><code>dan</code> 用于拆分 <code>s</code> 中的每一个单词， <code>ci</code> 是目标单词， <code>cur</code> 是下标， <code>ans</code> 输出答案。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>输入并解决大小写问题。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">cin&gt;&gt;ci;\n  for(int i=0;i&lt;ci.size();++i)ci[i]=tolower(ci[i]);\n  getchar();\n  getline(cin,s);\n  s+=' ';\n  for(int i=0;i&lt;s.size();++i)s[i]=tolower(s[i]);</code></pre>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>统计与计数。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">for(int i=0;i&lt;s.size();++i)\n{\n      if(s[i]==' '){\n          if(dan==ci){\n              ans++;\n              if(cur==-1)cur=i-ci.size();\n          }\n          dan=\"\";\n      }\n      else dan+=s[i];\n}</code></pre>\n<p>如果是空格，判断是否与目标 <code>ci</code> 相同；如果不是，更新变量 <code>dan</code> 。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>输出</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">if(ans==0)printf(\"-1\");\nelse printf(\"%d %d\",ans,cur);</code></pre>\n<h2>代码</h2>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">#include&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;\nusing namespace std;\nstring dan,ci,s;\nint cur=-1,ans;\nint main()\n{\n    cin&gt;&gt;ci;\n    for(int i=0;i&lt;ci.size();++i)ci[i]=tolower(ci[i]);\n    getchar();\n    getline(cin,s);\n    s+=' ';//这行很重要，关系着最后一个单词会不会扫描到\n    for(int i=0;i&lt;s.size();++i)s[i]=tolower(s[i]);\n    for(int i=0;i&lt;s.size();++i)\n    {\n        if(s[i]==' '){\n            if(dan==ci){\n                ans++;\n                if(cur==-1)cur=i-ci.size();\n            }\n            dan=\"\";\n        }\n        else dan+=s[i];\n    }\n    if(ans==0)printf(\"-1\");\n    else printf(\"%d %d\",ans,cur);\n    return 0;\n}</code></pre>\n<p>评测记录。</p>\n<p>本人第一次写题解，如有码风或排版方面的不足，请多多谅解。</p>\n<p><del>求点赞。</del></p>\n    </article>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML=\"window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a6028c14c930cf26',t:'MTc5NTYyOTU2Ng=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a6028c14c930cf26',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);\";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body>\n</html>\n",
 "fetched_at": "2026-11-25 17:59:26"
